  "title": "Intro to Wood Carving (16+)",
  "summary": "Intro to Wood Carving (16+)",
  "description": "Register Here Starting December 8! Registration for all Aurora Cultural Centre programs is on the Town of Aurora’s e-PLAY website. All programs continue to be part of the Aurora Cultural Centre. January 12 – March 9, 2026 [SKIP February 16 – Family Day] Mondays | 6:30 – 9:00 pm | Ages 16+ Aurora Town Square – ATS Art Activity Room 50 Victoria Street, Aurora Formerly known as “Wood Carving”, this adult 8-week wood-carving program is perfect whether you are a beginner or a seasoned wood turner. Unlock the artistry within wood and learn to create intricate reliefs to dynamic sculptural pieces in the round. All materials are to be provided upon payment of a $80.00 materials fee and a $120.00 refundable deposit for borrowed tools payable to the instructor on date of the workshop. Materials List",
